  "gui.fletcherstrestle.guide.eagles.taming": "Tame a wild eagle by feeding it raw rabbit, cod or salmon (about a 1-in-3 chance each feed). A tamed eagle bonds to you and follows.",
  "gui.fletcherstrestle.guide.eagles.fetch": "Fetch: your eagle picks up arrows you've fired that landed nearby and returns them to your inventory.",
  "gui.fletcherstrestle.guide.eagles.hunt": "Hunt: mark a target through a spyglass and your eagle will dive at it.",
  "gui.fletcherstrestle.guide.eagles.perch.desc": "The Eagle Perch is a roost a tamed eagle can claim. A perched eagle stays put and waits there instead of following you — handy as a home base.",
